ple the Earth Federation government, and Cardeas Vist, the head of the family plans to hand them the key to it. Audrey, fearful of what will happen, wants to convince Vist not to give them the key. The Earth Federation's Londo Bell unit attacks the Sleeves and Banagher is drawn into the chaos.  \n  \n**Notes**:  \nAdapted from the light novel series that were later adapted into a feature film series.  \n* Day of the Unicorn: Chapters 1-12\n* Red Comet: Chapters 13-21\n* Palau Capture Battle: Chapters 22-26\n* Ghost of Laplace: Chapters 27-29\n* In the Depths of a Gravity Well: Chapters 30-38\n* The Black Unicorn: Chapters 39-51\n* The Sky and the Stars: Chapters 52-60\n* Over the Rainbow: Chapters 61-62\n\n\n\n---\n\n**Links:**  \n- [Original Novels (on Amazon.co.jp)](https://www.amazon.co.jp/gp/product/B07YZTJ135)","year":2010,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"78","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Thriller","Sci-Fi","Action","Psychological","Romance","Mecha","Adventure","Philosophical"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/c48abd82-74d0-4be7-a6f1-ccc436759643/5919ad60-8f43-43a5-82c4-95013c22c329.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manga","rating":9,"follows":749,"listAt":"2026-10-28T22:40:29.961Z","chapters":[{"id":"a9253d06-8361-47c1-9d8a-99c328ca0022","number":"31","volume":"7","title":"At the Bottom of the Gravity Well [Act.2]","lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2026-10-23T20:49:24+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d81cc605-c7a3-4111-b486-975bf2de247e","number":"30","volume":"7","title":"At the Bottom of the Gravity Well [Act.1]","lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2026-10-23T20:49:01+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2a76f3be-dbc1-47e9-85e4-ce4c501901e0","number":"29","volume":"7","title":"The Ghost of Laplace [Act.3]","lang":"en","pages":50,"createdAt":"2026-10-23T20:48:33+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c5ffe039-98f7-4232-9911-a858a0403e5f","number":"28","volume":"7","title":"The Ghost of Laplace [Act.2]","lang":"en","pages":